        "heading": "YAZ was born from the desire to create jewelry that does  more than adorn.",
        "heading_size": "h1",
        "text": "<p>It lives within time, becoming part of people’s<br/>stories and cherished memories. Created to bring<br/>clarity to a jewelry market crowded with noise and<br/>trends, YAZ rejects the notion that true luxury<br/>should be reserved for a select few or defined by<br/>excess. Instead, each piece is designed with<br/>restraint and responsibility, chosen thoughtfully<br/>rather than to impress through abundance.      <br/><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/></p>",
